{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大号白色标题首先吸引视线；随后下方粗体长段落中的紫色强调词「少露些心意，会不会少疼些」「自己反倒更难受」形成第二视觉入口。两个区域都比较醒目。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他正处在一段让自己很开心、但不确定能否长久的亲密关系里，想确认对方以后也不会改变。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、患得患失，隐约害怕失去和受伤。\",\n  \"missed\": \"从最初害怕给对方添负担，到如今害怕对方不再需要自己，这一心理变化没有直接抓到；收起心意与真心想对对方好的矛盾，也需要读周围文字才能理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样显眼的字争夺主视线：上方标题与下方粗体段落，下方紫色强调又形成额外视觉焦点。\",\n    \"单块文字较长，尤其下方段落包含好几层心理变化和转折。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块里：上方讲想确认关系不会改变，下方讲害怕不再被需要以及隐藏心意的痛苦，需要拼接才能理解完整处境。\",\n    \"放大的紫色词组虽然突出，但单独看只能传达怕疼、压抑心意和难受，不能独立说明具体处境。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f16b2b77-1f97-4e4e-ae89-d42c47121bfe", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T011934654431Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.531, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:20:21.187158+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "78ebe107af55998030db67dd662bb6302876d150759ac2a5788a9c502d95aad1", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3